{"id": 90, "ts": 1781264876.5986567, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 5, "agent": "agent_1", "message": "I appreciate Sofia\u2019s emphasis on Candidate\u202fD\u2019s responsibility, problem\u2011solving and concentration, but I remain convinced that Candidate\u202fC is the stronger overall fit.\u202fC\u2019s record shows **100\u202f% reliability**, a **positive crew atmosphere**, and the ability to **make correct decisions quickly**, which directly satisfy our core safety criteria of operational reliability, stress resilience and decision quality.\u202fIn contrast, D\u2019s **arrogance**, **weak leadership** and **hot temper** raise unresolved risks for crew\u2011resource\u2011management and professional communication\u2014areas where we have no concrete evidence of mitigation.\u202fWithout clear proof that D can consistently maintain the collaborative cockpit environment required for long\u2011distance flights, C\u2019s proven reliability and decision\u2011making outweigh the temperament concerns.\u202fTherefore, I keep my provisional recommendation for **Candidate\u202fC**."}
